## User

The n-th Fibonacci number, with fib 0 = 0 and fib 1 = 1.

## Type

type
```agda
fib : ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
fib 0 = 0
fib 1 = 1
fib n = fib (n - 1) + fib (n - 2)
```

## agda

```agda
fib-lemma : (n : ℕ) → fib n ≡ fib (n - 1) + fib (n - 2)
fib-lemma 0 = refl
fib-lemma 1 = refl
fib-lemma n = fib-lemma (n - 1) + fib-lemma (n - 2)
```

## agda

```agda
fib-lemma' : (n : ℕ) → fib n ≡ fib (n - 1) + fib (n - 2)
fib-lemma' 0 = refl
fib-lemma' 1 = refl
fib-lemma' n = fib-lemma'
